{"version":1,"content":"<p>最平$328 !新加任食龍蝦+日本A5和牛</p>\n<h2>千海水產銅鑼灣+元朗連開兩店！</h2>\n<p>人氣即撈海鮮火鍋放題店「千海水產海鮮火鍋放題」開業後每日訂座瘋狂爆滿。最近餐廳宣佈即將於10月17日於銅鑼灣開設旗艦店，同時間預告元朗分店亦將於10月下旬登場，連開兩間店！新店更新增任食龍蝦及日本A5和牛放題套餐，熟客都好期待！</p>\n<h2>最平$438任食龍蝦+日本A5和牛</h2>\n<p>新店繼續主打即撈活海鮮放題，最平$328任食3小時多達10款海鮮，包括花蟹、鮑魚、海蝦、沙白等，以及任食過百款火鍋配料、熟食、甜品和飲品。新店亦推出全新放題套餐，最平$438可以任食新鮮龍蝦及日本A5和牛，龍蝦肉質新鮮彈牙，口感紮實又鮮甜中；日本A5和牛霜降油花分布細緻均勻，肉質柔軟甘甜，入口即融！其他肉類仲可以選擇澳洲M5和牛、特上牛小排、美國牛肩胛片等，任撈10多款海鮮再打邊爐，夠哂滿足！</p>\n<p>千海水產海鮮火鍋放題<br/>\n地址：香港銅鑼灣百德新街 2–20 號恆隆中心 3 樓、元朗元龍街9號形點I二樓2043號鋪<br/>\n備註：銅鑼灣店10月17日下晝五點鐘正式試業、元朗店10月下旬登場<br/>\n訂座網站：<a href=\"https://inline.app/booking/-O6F2T55823UXDrfcB9q:inline-live-3?language=zh-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://inline.app/booking/-O6F2T55823UXDrfcB9q:inline-live-3?language=zh-hk</a></p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<p> <figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179213042475335774_7450516436ad1bd794efcf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179213042668123741_11773797856ad1bd7b0e7d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179213042888823103_8962706896ad1bd7d4044b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179213043054087110_11268842466ad1bd7ec8754.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179213043211793004_12246393086ad1bd8091c64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17921304338611389_2029405656ad1bd8235bd3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179213043564196179_5984492786ad1bd8422504.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeikjkgjKOv/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%96%b0%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1-%e5%8d%83%e6%b5%b7%e6%b0%b4%e7%94%a2-%e5%8d%b3%e